<title>UK: Mexico sets 750 million mark 11-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Mexico sets 750 million mark 11-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MEXICO</p>
<p> AMT    750 MLN DEM   COUPON     8.00	MATURITY    23.JUL.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.125   PAY DATE    23.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  3.00	REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	NON GIVEN</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB/MX</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  MEXICO    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.875     SELL CONC  1.625     LISTING FEE 0.50</p>
<p> NOTES	6.00 PCT BUND DUE 04.JUL.07 AROUND 5.65 PCT YIELD.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
